@extends('layouts.crm',['title'=>$employee->exists?'Edit Employee':'Create Employee']) @section('content')<form method="POST" action="{{ $employee->exists?route('employees.update',$employee):route('employees.store') }}" class="bg-white rounded-xl p-6 max-w-3xl">@csrf @if($employee->exists)@method('PUT')@endif<div class="grid md:grid-cols-2 gap-5">@foreach([['name','Name','text'],['email','Email','email'],['phone','Phone','text'],['employee_code','Employee Code','text'],['password','Password','password']] as $f)<label><span class="text-sm">{{ $f[1] }}</span><input name="{{ $f[0] }}" type="{{ $f[2] }}" value="{{ $f[0]=='password'?'':old($f[0],$employee->{$f[0]}) }}" class="mt-1 w-full border rounded-lg p-2"></label>@endforeach<label><span class="text-sm">Role</span><select name="role" class="mt-1 w-full border rounded-lg p-2">@foreach($roles as $role)<option @selected($employee->hasRole($role->name))>{{ $role->name }}</option>@endforeach</select></label><label><span class="text-sm">Branch</span><select name="branch_id" class="mt-1 w-full border rounded-lg p-2"><option value="">Select</option>@foreach($branches as $x)<option value="{{ $x->id }}" @selected($employee->branch_id==$x->id)>{{ $x->name }}</option>@endforeach</select></label><label><span class="text-sm">Team</span><select name="team_id" class="mt-1 w-full border rounded-lg p-2"><option value="">Select</option>@foreach($teams as $x)<option value="{{ $x->id }}" @selected($employee->team_id==$x->id)>{{ $x->name }}</option>@endforeach</select></label></div><button class="mt-6 bg-blue-600 text-white px-6 py-2 rounded-lg">Save Employee</button></form>@endsection